Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:12.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,上了11点新闻的银行劫匪是你 可不是我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were the bank robber on the 11:00 news, not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 我是维克多·亨德里克森探员{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - This is special agentvictor hendrickson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:17.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我的任务是抓住你 不一定是活的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my jobto bring you in alive's a bonus but not necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:19.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我已经找了你好几周了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been looking for you for weeks now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:21.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还有 对 我也知道萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, yes, I know about sam, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.10,0:00:24.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道圣路易斯的凶杀案 还有你在巴尔的摩玩的小把戏{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know about the murder in st. Louis, thehoudini act you pulled in baltimore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:27.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,以及那些掘墓和盗窃{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know about the desecrations and the thefts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:29.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我还知道你们的爸爸{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know about your dad.{\r}
