Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:34.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,咱们搞砸了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are so screwed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:00.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这就明白了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, this makes a lot of sense.{\r}
