Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:14.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got that ready.{\r}
