Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.70,0:03:22.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不想再说第二遍{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna say it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:47.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- B区 熄灯 - 明白 熄灯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lights out, "b" block. - Copy that.Lights out{\r}
