Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:11.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这边{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.20,0:05:20.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我不喜欢这个计划 迪恩 - 是啊 我知道 你都说了很多遍了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I hate this plan, dean. - Yeah, I got that the first 10 times I heard it.{\r}
