Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:35.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好 这就对了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's right.{\r}
