Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.30,0:06:48.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,来的正好 我想要奇士汉堡{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's about time.I'll have a cheeseburger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:51.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,双份洋葱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Extra onions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:57.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你觉得自己很幽默 - 我觉得自己挺可爱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You think yo're fine. - I think I'm adorable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.50,0:07:00.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,终于能见到你很荣幸 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a pleasure tofinally meet you in person, dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.30,0:07:06.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是维克多·亨德里克森探员 这是我的搭档雷迪探员{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm special agentvictor hendrickson.This is my partner special agent reidy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:09.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,亨德里克森{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hendrickson.{\r}
