Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.10,0:07:19.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,噢 拍的不错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, nice shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.90,0:07:23.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等你到了安哥拉监狱 可以挂在自己的囚室里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can hang that upin your cell at supermax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:26.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许我们可以忘记汉堡{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we can just forget the cheeseburgers, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.50,0:07:29.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,噢 对了 继续装吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah.Keep that game face on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.60,0:07:31.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,继续掩饰你有多心慌意乱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try and cover up how cornered you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.40,0:07:33.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,给他念念罪名{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Read him the charges.{\r}
