Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:38.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,直接说重点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skip to the good ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:41.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,持枪抢劫 绑架和 噢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Armed robbery, kidnapping, and, oh,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.10,0:07:43.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,3件一级谋杀案{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three counts of first-degree murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.70,0:07:47.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,密尔沃基案件之后 你弟弟也成了谋杀案的嫌犯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And after milwaukee, your brother isnow a suspect in a murder case himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.60,0:07:48.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我得说 你们两个家伙{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say, for you two{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:51.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,"无恶不作"这词实在太便宜你们了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"screwed to hell"is a major understatement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:54.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这个嘛 留得青山在 不怕没柴烧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, where there's life, there's hope, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.30,0:07:59.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,噢 这就是我四处抓你们的时候一直想的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw. See, that's what I kept thinking as I wassearching for your asses all over hell and gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.10,0:08:04.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你的爸爸把你们训练得不错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your dad taught you well.{\r}
