Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.10,0:13:39.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 好了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.10,0:13:41.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,瞧 你就得这么跟那些家伙说话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, that's how you got to talk to these guys.{\r}
