Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:56.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,既然要动手就不要打脸和要害{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can end this right now. No harm, no foul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.90,0:14:06.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,够了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough!{\r}
