Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.10,0:14:13.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是 长官 老大{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.40,0:14:22.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字 - 温彻斯特{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's your name? - Winchester.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.30,0:14:26.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,温彻斯特… 这可不是个好开头{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, winchester...not a good start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.40,0:14:35.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,关禁闭{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Solitary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:38.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你也是 卢卡斯 - 是 长官{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You too, lucas. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.10,0:14:40.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,玩的挺开心 对吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we having fun yet, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.55,0:15:05.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,要是有个棒球就好了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I had a baseball.{\r}
