Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.15,0:15:15.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你知道 就像史蒂夫·麦奎因 - 什么 史蒂夫·麦奎因{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know, like like steve mcqueen. - Yeah?Steve Mcqueen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:19.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想要个球棒 打瘪你的脑袋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I wish I had a bat so Icould bash your fricking head in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.45,0:15:21.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.45,0:15:25.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 患难见真情的时刻结束了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, so much for the bonding in solitary moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.15,0:15:42.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,见鬼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.65,0:16:00.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,卢卡斯 听我说 千万别动{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucas, listen to me.Stay very still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:47.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 汗迪克森 - 嗨 丹尼尔斯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hendrickso-Hey, daniels. - Hendrickson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.20,0:16:50.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 能和你谈谈吗 - 请坐{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I have a word? - Have a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:53.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 有什么事 - 我看过温彻斯特兄弟的案卷了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's on your mind? - I've been going through the winchester charges{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:55.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我得说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I got to say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.68,0:16:59.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 有些奇怪的矛盾之处 - 欢迎光临我的世界{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- there aresome weird in consistencies. - Welcome to my world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.64,0:17:03.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我和巴尔的摩的一个警察谈过了 她发誓{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I talked to a cop in balti more who swears up and down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.30,0:17:06.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这对兄弟救了她的命还帮她抓住凶手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these boys saved her life andhelped her catch a killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:09.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你负责的那件密尔沃基银行劫案的命{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's a witness to your bank robbery in milwaukee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.19,0:17:10.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一个目击者也说萨姆和迪恩救了她的命{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She swears sam and dean saved her life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.70,0:17:13.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 从谁那儿救了她 - 关于那个 她有点记不清了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Saved her from what? - She was a little unclear on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.60,0:17:15.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,因为她脑子有病{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's because she's nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:19.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,听着 我当时就在密尔沃基 我和她谈过 和所有的证人都谈过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I was in milwaukee.I spoketo her.I spoke to all the witnesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.70,0:17:21.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 然后 - 然后{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And? - And{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:24.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我只知道一点 不管这俩家伙去哪儿都有人死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all I know is, wherever these guys go, people die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.90,0:17:27.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 就这么简单 - 我不这么认为{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's that simple. - I don't know that it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:31.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我并不那么肯定他们一定有罪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just don't seem cut and dry guilty to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:35.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得还有别的内情 - 比如什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think there's more to this. - Like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.40,0:17:36.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.40,0:17:39.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我说不好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't put my finger on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:40.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.50,0:17:44.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 很奇怪 - 奇怪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Strange. - Strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.90,0:17:48.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是啊 好了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.70,0:17:52.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,大人们有事要办 所以…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grown-ups are trying toget some work done here, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:55.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果你不介意的话…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you don't mind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.90,0:18:13.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你好吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.80,0:18:19.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我54岁 在一个窗户上都是铁栏杆的厕所擦地{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm 54 years old, mopping the floorof a crapper with bars on the windows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.78,0:18:21.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你觉得我好不好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you think I'm doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:27.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧 破冰失败{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.Bad icebreaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.30,0:18:31.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我叫萨姆 - 兰德尔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sam. - Randall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:34.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 兰德尔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to meet you.Randall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.10,0:18:38.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 那个警卫死的那晚你是不是也在 - 对{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, weren't you there the night that guard died? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.90,0:18:40.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,发生什么了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:44.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 他们说是工作压力 - 是吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They say the stress of the job got him. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:46.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那你怎么说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.00,0:18:53.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你管这事干嘛 小子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you inside, kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:19:00.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,因为我有个笨蛋老哥{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I got an idiot for a brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:03.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 好理由 - 是啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That'll do it. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.90,0:19:08.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这地方没那么糟 比起老囚室那边 这里简直算是希尔顿酒店了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, this place aingt so bad.Compared tothe old cellblock, this is the damn hilton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:14.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你还在老囚室那边呆过 - 噢 当然 我可是个常客{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You spent time in the old block? - Oh, yeah, I was a regular customer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.70,0:19:17.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 马克·穆迪不是也关在那儿 - 他是被关过那儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Didn't they have mark moody there for a while? - He was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:22.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那个疯子死的那天晚上 我也在{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was there, too, the night that lunatic bought it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.90,0:19:25.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是吗 听说是心脏病发作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?It was a heart attack, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.30,0:19:30.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,当然 他的心脏在警卫拿他的脑袋 做挥棒练习之后就停了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, his heart stopped right after the guardstopped using his head for batting practice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.60,0:19:34.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,第二天早上 我清理他囚室里的血迹 简直一团糟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next morning, I was in hiscell, mopping up the blood.What a mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.80,0:19:38.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等等 这么说他… 他是被活活打死 却没人上报{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. So he... he was beatenand nobody reported it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.80,0:19:43.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,闭上你的嘴 除非你想死于同样的心脏病 明白{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kept your mouth shut, unless you wantedto die from the same heart attack, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.30,0:19:50.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,兰德尔 现场到底有多少血迹{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Randall, exactly how much blood was there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.60,0:19:57.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我跟 - 三个A{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Call. - Three aces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.90,0:20:01.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这就是爆冷门{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a bad beat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:04.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,确实是惨痛一击 但我是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a bad beat, but, see, I'm full...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.20,0:20:06.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也是三个A{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}3s over aces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.20,0:20:11.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,抱歉 游戏规则如此 老兄{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.Hey, it's a cruel game, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.70,0:20:16.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,抱歉 老兄{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:23.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 这也太容易了 - 你根本不抽烟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's like picking low-hanging fruit. - You don't even smoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.60,0:20:26.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这在监狱里能当钱用{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the currency of the realm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.90,0:20:30.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 听着 我打听到了穆迪的事情 - 我也是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look. I got a good lead on moody. - Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:32.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 他的灵魂昨晚还来看了看我 - 什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- His spirit paid a little visit last night. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:37.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,表停了 灯在闪 冷得很 我是说 他该做的都做了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The clock stopped, the flickering lights, coldspot...I mean, he did everything but yell boo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.50,0:20:39.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 哦 怎么回事 - 他从我面前走过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, what happened? - He walked right by me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.10,0:20:42.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,从那声惨叫来看卢卡斯没那么幸运{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucas wasn't so lucky.I mean, the way he was screaming...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.00,0:20:45.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他是很混 但也不该那样惨死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}guy was a jerk, but hedidn't deserve to go like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.20,0:20:47.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,穆迪那你发现什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you find out on moody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.51,0:20:49.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想或许能在他牢房里找到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I think I know where wemight find his remains{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:53.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 残留的血迹 血迹 - 我还以为是死于心脏病{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- blood in his old cell. - The blood?I thought it was a heart attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.20,0:20:55.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,记录是的 是狱警伪造的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was, after the guards worked him over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.30,0:20:57.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现场血迹多得拖了半天{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was so much bloodin there, they had trouble mopping it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.10,0:21:01.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我们怎么进去 - 我有个计划{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How we gonna get in? - I got a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:04.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,智多星萨姆 我就知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the sammy I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.10,0:21:06.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你就像克林特·伊斯特伍德的"逃出亚卡拉"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're likeclint eastwood from "escape from alcatraz."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.90,0:21:09.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,问题是 就算找到血迹怎么烧毁{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Problem is, if we find something, how are we gonna burn it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.00,0:21:11.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有然烧剂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have any accelerant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:14.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,问得好 我有"大逃亡"里的詹姆斯·加纳的技术{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good thing I'm like jamesgarner from "the great escape."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.60,0:21:21.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们 谁想做个交易{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, fellas!Who's ready to deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.30,0:21:27.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 这样能行吗 - 基本能行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You sure about this? - Pretty sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.90,0:21:31.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 鉴于我们身处的环境 "基本能行" 可不行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, considering our circumstances, I'd like a little better than "pretty sure."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:34.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那好 真的基本能行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay...really pretty sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.00,0:21:37.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我要有点嚼劲的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like mine al dente.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.90,0:21:41.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好极了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.70,0:21:46.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在等餐后甜点 泰尼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save room for dessert, tiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.30,0:21:51.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 我想问你 因为我没法不注意你那2吨的身材{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I wanted to ask you, becauseI couldn'thelp but notice that you are two tons of fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.50,0:21:56.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只是好奇 这是甲状腺问题 还是一些自卑的问题{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just curious...is it likea thyroid problem, oris it some deep sea ted self esteem issue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.20,0:22:01.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,因为 你知道 他们只是甜甜圈{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because, you know, they're, uh...they're just dough nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.50,0:22:02.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是爱人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:28.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,伙计们 帮把手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, give me a hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.20,0:22:57.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们晚来一步你就挂了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we'd waited any longer, you'd be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.10,0:22:59.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们来的可真早{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You waited long enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.10,0:23:04.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,为了你自己 不许回嘴{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do yourself a favor.Don't talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.70,0:23:07.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,把他们都带到医务室{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take them both up to the infirmary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.90,0:24:06.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 泰尼 - 什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, tiny. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.70,0:24:10.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,抱歉之前那样说你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, sorry about the things I was saying earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.50,0:24:14.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,无法解释但我必须惹毛你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't really tell you whybut I had to get you angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.10,0:24:16.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以 嗯…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.30,0:24:19.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 无论如何 抱歉 - 没关系{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- anyway, sorry. - It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.70,0:24:24.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,事实是我确实自卑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Truth is, I have low-self-esteem issues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.30,0:24:27.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我老爸经营露天煤矿 哥哥不务正业{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My old man treated meand my brother like crap,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.90,0:24:29.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,直到爸爸死前才悔改{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right up till the day he died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.90,0:24:32.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 他怎么死的 - 我哥枪杀了他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How'd he die? - My brother shot him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.30,0:24:35.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这样啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.30,0:24:43.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 哦 糟糕 - 怎么了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, crap. - What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.20,0:25:06.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.40,0:25:19.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,发生什么了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.30,0:25:47.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 哦 不 不 - 泰尼 泰尼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh! No! No! - Tiny! Tiny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.50,0:25:49.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,警卫{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.80,0:25:51.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,警卫{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.75,0:26:00.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等等 你说不是穆迪干的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. So you're telling me it wasn't moody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.55,0:26:03.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,除非他喜欢扮成护士{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not unless he liked goingaround dressed like a nurse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.35,0:26:06.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 可怜的泰尼 大块头泰尼 - 等等 那这 这是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Poor tiny, man.Poor giant tiny. - Wait, so this is...this is, like{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.85,0:26:09.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 在这工作的护士的灵魂 - 我不知道 我猜是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- the ghost of some nurse who worked here or something? - I don't know, man.I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.85,0:26:12.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在这一点上 "我不明白"这和我有什么关系{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At this point, "I don'tknow"isn't working for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.55,0:26:16.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,知道吗 我以为这儿的工作结束了 我和迪肯 说了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, uh, I thought we were done.I called Deacon.It's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.25,0:26:17.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们今晚就走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting out tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.80,0:26:19.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那我们就要赶紧查查了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess we got to do some quick research, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.15,0:26:22.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,怎么查 我是说 或许你没注意{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How?I mean, maybe you haven't noticed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.75,0:26:24.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们在监狱里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're in jail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.25,0:26:26.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你想知道护士的情况{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to know about some nurse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.85,0:26:29.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你为什么想知道 - 我们自有原因{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why you want to know? - We got our reasons,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.15,0:26:32.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是 嗯 和我们说说绝对值得{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but, uh, we'll make it worth your while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.75,0:26:41.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么 这个护士 灰白色头发 一只眼睛有问题 你想起来没{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, this nurse, she would have white hair, onescrewed-up eye...is that ringing a bell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.15,0:26:45.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 是的 是的 我记得她 - 你记得名字吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah.Yeah, I remember her. - You remember her name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.05,0:26:47.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 还有点模糊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's still kind of fuzzy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.90,0:26:55.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,给他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.55,0:26:58.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我赚来的 - 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I earned these. - Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.35,0:27:11.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,格洛克纳 格洛克纳护士 70年代在这工作的讨厌的老女人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glockner...nurse glockner.Nasty old bitch worked here in the '70s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.35,0:27:13.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你认识她 - 见过一次{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You knew her? - I met her once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.45,0:27:17.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,去打破伤风 她对着我的胳膊就是猛的一戳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had to geta tetanus shot.She damnnear jabbed the needle through my arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.45,0:27:20.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 至少我还活着 - 你什么意思{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- At least I got out of there alive. - What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.35,0:27:23.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我听过不少传言 真假就难说了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard these stories.Idon't know if they were true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.85,0:27:26.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 囚犯是个大嘴巴 但我们的话不太可信 - 什么传言{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cons love to talk, but we're all liars. - What kind of stories?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.15,0:27:31.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,人们经常因感冒走进去 之后就被裹尸袋抬出来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys would go up with a cold.Next thing you know, they're in a body bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.75,0:27:34.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,都是心脏病猝发 无论老少{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A whole rash of heart attacks...young guys, old guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.50,0:27:35.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 心脏病 - 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Heart attacks? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.08,0:27:38.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,说是格洛克纳痛恨囚犯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The story was glockner had it out for cons{\r}
