Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.55,0:33:45.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,知道吗 真希望看看亨德里克森的表情{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I almost wish Icould see hendrickson's face.{\r}
