Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.15,0:33:52.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我们还没真正脱险 迪恩 知道吗 - 是啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're not really out of the woods yet, dean, you know? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.55,0:33:57.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,说得好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.35,0:34:07.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我说过了 其中一人走到我身后{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you.One of them came up behind me.{\r}
