Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.85,0:34:47.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,问题很简单 你和迪恩说了些什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an easy question.What did you and Dean talk about?{\r}
