Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.65,0:35:00.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,告诉我 他说过什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, tell me what he said.{\r}
